---
import NewsletterForm from './NewsletterForm.astro';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="foot-top">
      <div class="foot-claim">
        <p class="foot-big">On ne naît pas orateur.<br />On le devient, séance après séance.</p>
        <p class="foot-sub">Parlement JPV — lycée Jean-Pierre Vernant, Sèvres. Instance encadrée par le CVL et deux professeures référentes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="foot-nl">
        <h4>La lettre du Parlement</h4>
        <p>Une fois par mois : prochaines séances, candidatures, rapports. Rien d'autre.</p>
        <NewsletterForm compact />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="foot-grid">
      <div><h4>Le Parlement</h4><a href="/institution">Le Parlement</a><a href="/qui-sommes-nous">Le bureau</a><a href="/charte">Charte officielle</a><a href="/rapports">Rapports</a><a href="/medias">Ils parlent de nous</a></div>
      <div><h4>Participer</h4><a href="/agenda">Séances</a><a href="/actualites">Actualités</a><a href="/galerie">Galerie</a><a href="/rejoindre" class="hide-member">Rejoindre l'instance</a><a href="/evenement">Événements</a><a href="/candidature">Candidature au bureau</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a></div>
      <div><h4>Suivre</h4><a href="https://instagram.com/parlementjpv" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/parlementjpv/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a><a href="/newsletter">Newsletter</a><a href="/agenda.ics">Agenda (.ics)</a></div>
      <div><h4>Légal</h4><a href="/mentions-legales">Mentions légales</a><a href="/confidentialite">Confidentialité</a><a href="/newsletter/desinscription">Se désinscrire</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="foot-bottom"><span>© {year} Parlement JPV</span><span>Site sans cookie, sans pub, sans pistage.</span></div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer { background: var(--nuit); color: #fff; margin-top: clamp(56px, 8vw, 110px); padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px) 0 24px; }
  :root[data-theme='dark'] .site-footer { background: #06102a; }
  .foot-top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: 48px; padding-bottom: 40px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); }
  .foot-big { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.025em; margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 18ch; }
  .foot-sub { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 0.95rem; max-width: 46ch; }
  .site-footer h4 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 10px; color: #fff; }
  .foot-nl p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .foot-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 28px; padding: 36px 0; }
  .foot-grid a { display: block; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82); text-decoration: none; padding: 3px 0; font-weight: 500; }
  .foot-grid a:hover { color: #fff; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--rouge); text-decoration-thickness: 3px; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .foot-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .foot-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .foot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
</style>
